<title>USA: U.S. Surgical shares rise after forecast.</title>
<headline>U.S. Surgical shares rise after forecast.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Surgical Corp shares moved higher on Wednesday after the company's chairman said he expected its 1997 sales to accelerate.</p>
<p>Shares rose 2-5/8, or just over six percent to 46-1/4 in heavy trading.</p>
<p>&quot;I do expect our sales to accelerate at a much more rapid rate than they have in the past year in 1997 and a hell of a lot more in 1998,&quot; Leon Hirsch said at an unveiling of new products in San Francisco to the American college of Surgeons meeting on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
